  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2103.01 Prohibited Person. A license shall be denied if any of the following factors exist:\n\n(a) The applicant is prohibited by federal law from possessing a firearm; or\n\n(b) The applicant is prohibited by New Hampshire statute from possessing a firearm.\n\nSource. #1911, eff 1-11-82; ss by #2608, eff 1-31-84 EXPIRED: 1-31-90 (formerly Saf-P 503.01)\n\nNew. #4891, eff 7-31-90; ss by #6269, eff 6-25-96; ss by #8104, INTERIM, eff 6-25-04, EXPIRES: 12-22-04; ss by #8189, eff 10-15-04; ss by #10380, eff 7-17-13; ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24",
